{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/council-tax-information-letter-42026-technical-consultation-improving-council-tax-enforcement","content_id":"4bdceb77-3245-41d9-975f-336df1966f59","description":"Update on publication of technical consultation and new burdens assessment.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9364882","isbn":"","title":"Council tax information letter 4/2026: Technical consultation improving council tax enforcement","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/council-tax-information-letter-42026-technical-consultation-improving-council-tax-enforcement/council-tax-information-letter-42026-technical-consultation-improving-council-tax-enforcement"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This information letter provides an update on the government’s <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/improving-enforcement-of-council-tax\">technical consultation on council tax enforcement</a>.</p>\n\n<p>This provides a link to the consultation and sets out what the government is seeking views on.</p>\n\n<p>This also provides an update on the government’s ongoing New Burdens assessment into changes to council tax administration.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-01T10:07:19Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9364882"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-01T11:07:19.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondenc